From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nabeel Sowan <nabeel@vibes.se>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 10:52:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] fix: wire the lid backlight-only checkbox to enable
 Apply

The checkbox was added without the signal connection its siblings carry, so
ticking it changed nothing the dialog noticed and the Apply button stayed
disabled. Connect its toggled(bool) to general_valueChanged(), the same slot
cB_actionLidDocked and the other general controls use.
---
 src/configure_Dialog.ui | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/configure_Dialog.ui b/src/configure_Dialog.ui
index 8b78df3..ce7df9e 100644
--- a/src/configure_Dialog.ui
+++ b/src/configure_Dialog.ui
@@ -2496,6 +2496,12 @@
         <receiver>configure_Dialog</receiver>
         <slot>general_valueChanged()</slot>
     </connection>
+    <connection>
+        <sender>cB_lidDisplayLightOnly</sender>
+        <signal>toggled(bool)</signal>
+        <receiver>configure_Dialog</receiver>
+        <slot>general_valueChanged()</slot>
+    </connection>
     <connection>
         <sender>pB_configNotify</sender>
         <signal>released()</signal>
